# T-Watch Step Counter - IoT Fitness Tracking Device

## Project Overview

This project implements a comprehensive fitness tracking system using the LilyGo T-Watch 2020 V3. The device functions as a smart step counter with cloud connectivity, providing users with real-time step tracking, historical data visualization, and competitive leaderboards through Firebase integration.

