#### Key Design Patterns

**State Management**: Global state variables with proper encapsulation
```cpp
extern Screen currentScreen;        // Current display state
extern bool refreshScreen;          // Update flag
extern uint32_t stepCount;         // Current step count
extern StepRecord stepHistory[3];   // Historical data
```

**Hardware Abstraction**: Centralized hardware access
```cpp
extern TTGOClass *ttgo;    // Main watch object
extern TFT_eSPI *tft;      // Display interface
extern BMA *sensor;        // Accelerometer access
```

**Modular Screen System**: Separate files for each screen with consistent interface
```cpp
void drawHomeScreen();                          // Render functions
void handleHomeTouch(TouchGesture, int16_t, int16_t);  // Input handlers
```

**Data Persistence Layer**: SPIFFS abstraction for reliable storage
```cpp
bool loadWiFiCredentials();    // Configuration loading
void saveStepHistory();        // Data persistence
bool initStorage();            // Storage initialization
```

